Sources/GrantivaCLI/RunCommand.swift:56:    @Option(name: .long, help: "Write this file once the run reaches a terminal state, containing its status. Deleted at startup, and always written — a setup failure records `failed` rather than leaving a waiter hanging. Missing parent directories are created. Wait on it with `while [ ! -f <path> ]; do sleep 0.2; done` instead of polling report.json — useful with --keep-alive, where the session outlives the flows.")
